Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Major holder change counts entries and exits between
 reconciled partitions

When both dates' holder rows add up to 100%, a holder missing at one date held
nothing then, so a controlling stake moving from one holder to another is a change
for both. Without reconciled partitions only holders reported at both dates are
compared, as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CfTpoii6QDStyTPdotmEdY
---
 src/finengine/ownership_metrics.py | 26 ++++++++++++++++----------
 tests/test_ownership_metrics.py    |  7 +++++++
